Z||000001||Standard||12-01-2001||03:43 AM||||well, anything other than a high output is a waste of time.  90-92 were the best years, but anything from 90-94 is good.  Factory stock rating is 180hp/165tq.  Any Grand Am, Olds Achieva or Olds Calais(maybe?) with the vin A would do.  Easy way... look at the IDI cover plate (big metal plate on top of the engine).. should say High Output DOHC 16 valve etc..<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
